Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

Thank you for your interest in Arizona State University! We do have a (name of degree here) that is 100 percent online and offered through ASU Online.

For more information on this program, I recommend contacting a representative from ASU Online at 1-866-277-6589 or via chat at http://asuonline.asu.edu/. The representative will be able to provide you with the best information on the process of transferring into one of our online programs, as well as on tuition and other important information about registering for classes.

Sincerely,

{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}
Admission Services
{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}

If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.

